Hi {Owner},

I build websites and inventory tools for independent car dealers and dealer groups. {Business Name} has good inventory and reviews, but the site has no trade-in value, the finance form is a basic contact form, and several cars have no price.

I built a sample instead of asking for a meeting: inventory filtered by rooftop, detail pages with history and inspection slots, a secure finance application, a trade-in form, reserve online and service booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

The site runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, inventory feed upkeep and reporting. Connections to your dealer management system are scoped separately.

Worth thirty minutes with you and your sales manager?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
